    NO networking. No direct transport in the view.
  Projection → GeofenceWidgetProjectionBuilder is a 1:1 port of the web derivations:
    hasCoords (`vLat !== 0 || vLon !== 0`), per-fence haversineMeters (R=6_371_000) or
    Infinity when no fix, inside = dist <= (radius ?? 0), name ?? '—', radius ?? 0,
    enabled ?? true, currentZone = first inside&&enabled, fmtRadius =
    fmtNumber(convertDistanceFromSI(m, unit),1)+' '+unit. Verified by executed tests below.
